  "agent_notes": [
    "The NIRF and university listings use the spelling ARMAPUR, while the institution's official site brands itself Armapore P.G. College and gives the matching Armapore Estate, Kanpur address; this spelling variation is documented rather than treated as a separate campus.",
    "The official site collectively exposes B.A., B.Com., M.A. Hindi Literature, M.A. English Literature, M.A. Economics, M.A. Political Science, M.Com., and a Ph.D. programme. However, Courses Offered lists M.A. subject options as Hindi, English, and Economics, while No. of Seats additionally lists M.A. Political Science, so the current catalogue is internally inconsistent.",
    "The Ph.D. entry is broad and does not enumerate current doctoral specializations or eligibility. Therefore course_catalogue_status is partial_official_website and record_status is manual_review.",
    "Normal TLS verification produced the managed proxy error 'self signed certificate in certificate chain'; public GET requests were retried with --insecure only after confirming the expected public hostnames."
